<title>MALTA: Malta retail prices fall slightly.</title>
<headline>Malta retail prices fall slightly.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malta's retail price index dropped by 0.89 points (0.87 percent) in July compared to the preceding month, the Malta Central Office of Statistics said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The index was 102.43 in June 1996 and 101.54 in July. The index for the same months in 1995 was 114.35 in June and 114.26 in July.</p>
